      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/kernel/reducer.ts:540 calls completionDecision without changed_paths, so a routine-declared task with floored paths can bypass Review when the complete action is reduced; carry the trusted snapshot paths through completion mutation and add a reducer-level regression test."
    },
    {
      "id": "review-ce7bf7d020bc-2-review-2",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-dynamic-review-obligation",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/commands/kernel.ts:305 leaves inspect risk.resolved equal to declared intent.risk, making it disagree with assurance.projection.risk and report floor_applied=false for dynamically Material work; derive this value with resolveProjectedRisk(intent, changedPaths)."
    },
    {
      "id": "review-1b9771653e6f-1-review-1",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-dynamic-review-obligation",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 2,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/kernel/completion.ts:46-53 accepts hash-only or omitted changed_paths and silently substitutes [], allowing a trusted Routine completion caller to suppress the changed-path risk floor; require changed_paths in the mutation contract and reject missing path evidence."
    },
    {
